  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1207.03 Procedural Hearings. All hearings held by the department pursuant to this section shall be conducted in accordance with the requirements of Saf-C 200.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 1200) #9810-A, eff 11-6-10",
